      "statement": "In Karpenter 1.0.0, the annotations karpenter.sh/do-not-consolidate, karpenter.sh/do-not-evict, and the tag karpenter.sh/managed-by are removed; karpenter.sh/managed-by is replaced by eks:eks-cluster-name, and the disruption taint key changed from karpenter.sh/disruption=disrupting:NoSchedule to karpenter.sh/disrupted:NoSchedule."
